    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim yana mutunta sirrinka kuma baya tattara bayananka.\n\n•Babu tracking: no ad SDKs, Analytics or marketing trackers.\n• Data tsaya akan na\'urarka: duk bayananka (wuri, settings, bookmarks) ana adana su a gida akan na\'urarka kawai. qibla a kan na\'urarka, kuma ba a taɓa aikawa zuwa kowane uwar garken waje ba.\n• Izinin kawai lokacin da ake buƙata: muna neman izini (wuri, sanarwa) kawai lokacin da wani fasali yana buƙatar su, tare da bayyanannen bayani.\n • Babu tilasta haɗin gwiwa: app yana aiki a layi; amfani da hanyar sadarwa gabaɗaya zaɓi ne don ƙarin abubuwa kamar zazzage karatun.\n\nWannan manufar wani bangare ne na ma\'ajiyar buɗaɗɗen tushe kuma tana buɗe don bitar al\'umma.</string>
